{
  "name": "GuestRating",
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "restaurant_id": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "session_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Split session the rating came from"
    },
    "stars": {
      "type": "number",
      "description": "1-5"
    },
    "comment": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Private feedback. Only collected on low ratings."
    },
    "guest_email": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Optional. Captured on the same screen."
    },
    "routed_to_google": {
      "type": "boolean",
      "default": false,
      "description": "True when the guest was shown the Google review handoff"
    },
    "alerted_at": {
      "type": "number",
      "description": "Unix ms the low-rating alert was sent. Null means no alert fired."
    },
    "created_at": {
      "type": "number",
      "description": "Unix timestamp ms"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "restaurant_id",
    "stars"
  ],
  "rls": {
    "_comment": [
      "Closed to admin on every verb. These two hold the whole B2B asset - the",
      "restaurant's guest email list and its private low-star feedback - and as",
      "nulls they were readable AND writable by anyone who knew the app id,",
      "which ships in the client bundle. Reachable anonymously through the",
      "app's own /api/apps proxy, so it was cross-tenant: any restaurant could",
      "read every other restaurant's guests.",
      "",
      "Nothing needs direct access now. Guests write via submitGuestRating and",
      "the dashboard reads via getRestaurantDashboardData, both asServiceRole,",
      "both deriving whose data it is from stored state rather than the body.",
      "Do not reopen a verb here to fix a broken screen - point the screen at a",
      "function instead."
    ],
    "create": {
      "user_condition": {
        "role": "admin"
      }
    },
    "read": {
      "user_condition": {
        "role": "admin"
      }
    },
    "update": {
      "user_condition": {
        "role": "admin"
      }
    },
    "delete": {
      "user_condition": {
        "role": "admin"
      }
    }
  }
}